  panels:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24c112dd4d3094892b5d218f248ef7e1, type: 3}
    caption: The last door slides open, and cool, fresh air rushes in. Nothing in
      the laboratory ever smelled like this.
    transition: 0
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6fc563af18c1a4fb38d3cb77b8a4b9e2, type: 3}
    caption: Beyond the glass there is a sky with no ceiling, and a city that glows
      all the way to the horizon.
    transition: 1
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 43d8bb89bcc954c48944b2dc5bba7003, type: 3}
    caption: For the first time, the rats stand in the open. It is bigger, louder
      and wilder than any test course.
    transition: 0
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c29d048ed10624dabaeabf39512c506b, type: 3}
    caption: Whatever waits out here, they will face it together. They are never
      going back in.
    transition: 1
